  "decision_rule": "Latest owner-approved future sequence: AI editorial agent drafts and runs all configured checks; up to 2 substantive targeted agent corrections with full fresh checks; if unresolved, hand over immutable text+checks+history to ChatGPT editorial escalation for exactly 1 targeted correction and full fresh checks; if still unresolved, deliver article and remaining issues to owner. A high score alone is not proof of authorship or a mandate to rewrite. Until independent validation, threshold 30 is diagnostic only. No automatic publication.",
